    "comment": "Pane pickers, the Ctrl-Tab switcher and dock sizes, as in the viewer (the shell's overlay has the key context `Chorong PanePicker` / `Chorong PaneSwitcher`, so the lab repeats Ctrl-Tab there).",
    "context": "LayoutLab",
    "bindings": {
      "cmd-k /": "chorong::FocusPane",
      "cmd-k shift-m": "chorong::MovePaneTo",
      "cmd-k shift-b": "chorong::BringFromTray",
